flowchart TD
    Player["Player input<br/>numeric guess"] --> UI["Streamlit UI<br/>app.py"]
    UI --> Guardrails["Input and state guardrails<br/>validate guesses and state; enforce bounds and turn limit"]
    Guardrails --> Engine["Game engine<br/>logic_utils.py<br/>secret remains here"]
    Engine -->|Player hint| UI

    Engine -->|Too High, Too Low, or Win only| Observe
    subgraph BotAgent["GuesserBot agent<br/>bot_agent.py"]
        Observe["Observe outcome"] --> Narrow["Narrow range"]
        Narrow --> Midpoint["Plan midpoint"]
        Midpoint --> Act["Act<br/>submit bot guess"]
    end
    Act -->|Bot guess| Guardrails
    Guardrails -->|Validated bot guess| Engine

    Guardrails --> Logs["Decision and safety logs"]
    Act --> Logs
    Logs --> UI
    UI --> Output["UI output<br/>hints, scores, turns, winner, and bot log"]
    Output --> Review["Human review through the UI"]

    Pytest["pytest"] -.-> Guardrails
    Pytest -.-> Engine
    Pytest -.-> Observe
    Evaluator["Exhaustive evaluator<br/>evaluate_bot.py"] -.-> Guardrails
    Evaluator -.-> Engine
    Evaluator -.-> Observe
